OL,3,GNEWSAVillage's first class birthday
OL,4,Asurprise for postie
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents turned out to surprise their
OL,7,Fmuch-loved postman on his 50th birthday
OL,8,Fafter he left it too late to book the
OL,9,Fday off.
OL,11,FLee Schuller, who has been delivering
OL,12,Fletters and parcels in Beeford, East
OL,13,FYorkshire, for more than half his life,
OL,14,Fsaid he did not want a fuss for his
OL,15,Fbirthday.
OL,17,FBut more than 250 residents decorated
OL,18,Fthe village and gathered at the
OL,19,Fcommunity centre to show their love and
OL,20,Fsing him happy birthday.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
